# ---- the packaged submission archive is a build artifact, not source ----
# Rebuild it with scripts/package_submission.py, which audits it as it writes.
/dist/
.vite/
.sovra_work/
.sovra_work_test/
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite3-wal
*.sqlite3-shm
.voice_preview.json
*.log

# ---- the measured evidence ships with the repository ----
# RESULTS.json, PROVIDER_VERIFICATION.json and PROOF.{json,md} are the observed
# results a reviewer is meant to read, and they contain no credential: every
# credential field in them passes through the application's masking. They are
# regenerated by `make evaluate`, `make verify-providers` and
# `scripts/export_proof.py`. `make audit` gates them before release.

